n&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/th&gt;&lt;td&gt;2007-04-28&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;14/23&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;344/106&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th scope=&#039;row&#039;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;/tripinfo_item/2007-05-05/2007-04-16/2007-05-07&quot;&gt;San Lorenzo Tlalmimilolpan, Edo de Mexico to Amecameca&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/th&gt;&lt;td&gt;2007-05-05&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;54/87&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;1486/459&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th scope=&#039;row&#039;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;/tripinfo_item/2007-05-06/2007-04-16/2007-05-07&quot;&gt;Amecameca to Cholula, Puebla&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/th&gt;&lt;td&gt;2007-05-06&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;43/69&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;4096/1264&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;</description>
